{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_32fc08eee628f3710f89b0b2fb0ad37b549fbc4490aa8ef36a1e9ed5b58adc65"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README directs users to nimbalyst.com for downloads, documentation, and updates, and recommends migrating to Nimbalyst for active updates."},{"claim_ids":["clm_620ba0ff36ca4ad144c15e1cbddee59938f61ec9ee59ec52bd7249b79444ebfd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Crystal, formerly a multi-session AI code assistant manager, was deprecated in February 2026 and replaced by Nimbalyst, though users may continue using it."}],"claim_ids":["clm_32fc08eee628f3710f89b0b2fb0ad37b549fbc4490aa8ef36a1e9ed5b58adc65","clm_620ba0ff36ca4ad144c15e1cbddee59938f61ec9ee59ec52bd7249b79444ebfd"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:15:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_14e21f7f396f4dae9f94cb92f2ba1f1e","id":"pg_5027782da0a750d39465d4b4399e6fef","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/stravu-crystal-readme-md-1e18e0bc9812-d4b4399e6fef.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_ac645b08555d5dc39ee4c52cc5149c35"],"title":"stravu/crystal/README.md @ 1e18e0bc9812","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:15:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_14e21f7f396f4dae9f94cb92f2ba1f1e"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_022ce4afb6b97b9f6793c7c5103c946c15d4844d25e1fd5fd0f5538ff47a9f03"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product includes a diff viewer with Monaco-based editing, a commit dialog, file-path navigation within diffs, an auto-commit toggle, and @<file-path> file references."},{"claim_ids":["clm_068f4e3c4e037a8f6eee41a5146916425f8dc048382c8cabf84b4ae6843a1e19"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The changelog records use of the Claude Code SDK (updated to 2.0.0), Electron (temporarily at 37.6.0), and dependency updates driven by Dependabot security warnings."},{"claim_ids":["clm_46d6a8786daff376a8b77e568455af33829482df9335eb006577b37eddff08ff"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Crystal provides a panel-based workspace where multiple agent and terminal panels can exist inside a single session, with keyboard navigation between panels via Cmd+Option+Arrow."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8374eee84ff459b9433217c695226598f80d500cc78f784aaff21d88a984811e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Crystal can be installed on macOS via Homebrew with 'brew install --cask stravu-crystal', and Linux AppImage builds were added to the release process."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8ae27134a31a4d3337274d71077ca77c40db1e5a47953f17e4c9f04780396e40"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions support per-session model selection, an automatic model choice option, slash commands such as /context in Claude Code panels, and AWS Bedrock model support."},{"claim_ids":["clm_945c5fa7f18d862c63ebd1ef7eaa6991651213d72f3d11710f61d53f7b731972"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The changelog states Crystal will not be updated in the future, and that the application no longer fails to load if Codex or Claude Code are not installed."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9dda593c68f1da416b7011e10cd9ea69d5487407cb208beea22f2283edce15f9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The changelog indicates Crystal manages AI coding sessions, supporting both Claude Code and OpenAI Codex agents."},{"claim_ids"